                    "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In mini.ai, is there a way to denote a visual-block selection?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Each region can have <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e50cf9de614500a20e47cfc50e30a100042f91c3/doc/mini-ai.txt#L192-L194\"><code class=\"notranslate\">vis_mode</code> field</a> to denote that.</p>",
